Player and Inventory algorithm:

Before player enters combat
  Open players inventory
  Make the player choose a singular weapon from their inventory
  Make the player choose 3 abilities from their inventory
  Player gets all of their consumables 
  Make player confirm their choices before entering combat

Player begins combat
  Display options for actions
  If attack is chosen
    Player attacks will be handled by combat system
  If player chooses skill
    Player will be able to choose from the 3 selected abilities
    Skills damage will be handled by combat system
  If player chooses consumables
    Show items in inventory
    Allow player to select item
    Give player option to confirm use of item
If player chooses block
  Combat system will handle the blocking
If player chooses retreat
  Calculate percentage to run by comparing player def lvl to enemies
